{{- $query := index (splitList "?" .VerificationURL) 1 -}}
{{- $verifyURL := printf "https://localhost:3000/verification?%s" $query -}}
Verify your account with the following code:

{{ .VerificationCode }}

or open the following link:

{{ $verifyURL }}

If this was not you, do nothing. This code / link expires in {{ .ExpiresInMinutes }} minutes.
